  "definition": "Certificate of Authority",
  "effectiveDate": "2016-12-05",
  "historyNote": "#1900, eff 1-1-82; ss by #4287, eff 7-1-87; ss by #5655, eff 7-1-93; ss by #7018, INTERIM, eff 7-1-99, EXPIRED: 10-29-99 New. #9335, eff 12-5-08; ss by #11194, eff 12-5-16",
